From: PiSight developers <pisight@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] uvc: read bounded diagnostic snapshots through the existing XU

Add selector 2 to the existing PiSightSettings1 extension unit for readback
of the saved diagnostic log or current DWC2 counters. Use 60-byte controls,
the actual UVC event payload limit, with generation-tagged immutable pages.
Allow only two fixed read-only source paths. Bound snapshot allocation and
reject malformed commands. Suppress per-transfer diagnostic logging for
this selector so reading a log does not flood the log itself.

This adds no USB interface or streaming endpoint and changes no video/audio
transport settings. Snapshot retrieval is host-triggered and should normally
run after capture to avoid adding measurement load. It is not a performance
fix; it lets future diagnostics be collected without removing the SD card.

